    "name":  "Pack LED CCT Controller 12-24V + C1 Remote Control - 2.4GHz",
    "reference":  "PACK-E2-RF-C1",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eSingle Color - Dual Color CCT Controller Pack 2.4GHz (12-24V) 4 Zones + C1 RF Remote Control (2.4GHz)\u003c/strong\u003e offers a versatile solution for your lighting needs. With a button, you can switch between two output modes: single color and dual white. The RF remote allows you to turn lights on and off, adjust brightness, and control color temperature in up to four zones. Additionally, it provides a control range of up to 30 meters, allowing you to manage your lighting devices from a considerable distance.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003ePack LED CCT Controller 12-24V + C1 Remote Control - 2.4GHz\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePack with bi-color CCT 2.4GHz controller (12-24V) 4 zones + C1 RF Remote Control (2.4GHz).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1. Versatile Output Modes: Single color and dual white\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2. RF Remote Control: ON/OFF, brightness, color temperature, 4 zones\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3. Wide Control Range: 30m\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4. Unlimited Expansion: Unlimited bulbs/strips in up to 4 zones\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIdeal for residential and commercial applications.\u003c/p\u003e",
